$$SYNTAX-LEVEL 2
*(mgdb-curation-issues
<a class="mgdb-skip-link" href="#ci-main">Skip to main content</a>

<main class="mgdb-page mgdb-hub-page mgdb-curation-issues-page" id="ci-main">

  <nav class="mgdb-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
    <a href="/genome">Genomes</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
    <span aria-current="page">$(page_title)</span>
  </nav>

  <section class="mgdb-hero" aria-labelledby="ci-title">
    <div class="mgdb-hero-emblem ci-emblem">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 96 96" role="img" aria-label="A magnifying glass over a strand of sequence">
        <path d="M12 62h24 M60 62h24" stroke="#7fae8c" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <path d="M20 54v16 M28 54v16 M68 54v16 M76 54v16" stroke="#7fae8c" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <circle cx="48" cy="44" r="20" fill="#e8f4ec" stroke="#235c37" stroke-width="4" />
        <path d="M62 58 L80 76" stroke="#235c37" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <path d="M48 34v14" stroke="#d99a0b" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <circle cx="48" cy="55" r="2.6" fill="#d99a0b" />
      </svg>
      <strong>Reported issues</strong>
      <span class="ci-emblem-meta">Open now</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-hero-body">
      <h1 id="ci-title">$(page_title)</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">$(page_blurb)</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="mgdb-section-tabs" aria-label="Sections on this page">
    <a href="#ci-open" class="is-current" aria-current="true">Open issues</a>
    <a href="#ci-report">Report one</a>
    <a href="#ci-related">Related resources</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="ci-open" aria-labelledby="ci-open-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="ci-open-title">Open issues</h2></div>
    </div>

    <p class="ci-scope"><strong>$(issue_count)</strong> open $(issue_noun), read from MaizeGDB's issue tracker as this page loaded. Only open issues are listed; a resolved one drops off.</p>

    $(issue_table)
  </section>

  <section id="ci-report" aria-labelledby="ci-report-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="ci-report-title">Report one</h2></div>
    </div>

    <div class="ci-prose">
      <p>If you have found a region of a reference assembly or a gene model that looks wrong, is missing, or represents variation poorly, tell us. The report form asks for the assembly, the location or the gene model identifier, and a description; an attachment is optional, and a screenshot of a browser view is often the fastest way to show what you mean.</p>
      <p>Reports go to MaizeGDB's curators, who work them with the group that produced the annotation. What appears on this page is what is still open.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="ci-actions">
      <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" href="/curation/GenomeIssue">Report an issue <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary" href="/feedback">Something else about MaizeGDB <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ci-related" class="mgdb-hub-related" aria-labelledby="ci-related-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="ci-related-title">Related resources</h2></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-resource-panel">
      <div class="mgdb-resource-list">
        <a href="$(other_url)">
          <strong>$(other_label)</strong>
          <span>$(other_blurb)</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/curation/GenomeIssue">
          <strong>Report an issue</strong>
          <span>The form these reports come in through</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/gene_center/gene">
          <strong>Gene Data Hub</strong>
          <span>The gene models these reports are about, one record each</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/genome">
          <strong>Genome Data Hub</strong>
          <span>Every assembly and annotation MaizeGDB holds, and how each was built</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/genomebrowser">
          <strong>Genome Browser Data Hub</strong>
          <span>Look at the region before you report it, and copy the coordinates</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
)
